      "writtenOn": "2026-02-25T00:18:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e James: I am not sure whether the prefix should be `AOMD_` or `AV1D_`. Is there a policy on this?\n\nNo, any policy was lost when vp9 was added and reused vp8 controls. The idea was that `VPXD_` or `VP[89]D` would be used for things that are codec agnostic versus codec specific. Since this is a single codec library it could go either way, though this definitely could be viewed as codec agnostic.",
      "parentUuid": "2f53ee79_aa2696ec",
      "revId": "8405ea69a958971a48742d94f941982b4683937a",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
    },
    {
